---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Archive everything unpinned in Reading or Paper trail, or in one sender's bundle there. Preview with --dry-run, then archive with --yes; `mxr undo` reverses it

Usage: mxr sweep [OPTIONS] <PLACE>

Arguments:
  <PLACE>  [possible values: reading, paper-trail]

Options:
      --sender <SENDER>    Only this sender's bundle
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --dry-run            Show what would be archived without changing anything
      --yes                Archive without asking
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
